Description: MOWIS Desktop Environment (core, metapackage)
 MOWIS (Mobile-Optimized Workspace Interface Shell) is a Samsung DeX-inspired
 desktop environment built on top of UKUI — a Qt-based fork of MATE.
 .
 MOWIS adds a DeX-style theme layer on top of UKUI's solid foundation,
 providing frosted-glass compositor effects, a top-bar taskbar, and
 keyboard shortcuts that mirror the Samsung DeX experience.
 .
 This package depends on the minimal set of components required to
 start a MOWIS desktop session.

