Description: MOWIS Desktop Environment (extras, metapackage)
 MOWIS (Mobile-Optimized Workspace Interface Shell) is a Samsung DeX-inspired
 desktop environment built on top of UKUI — a Qt-based fork of MATE.
 .
 This package installs extra optional components for a more complete
 MOWIS desktop experience.
